// GTK4 platform package.
//
// Each component in gtk4.sngl overrides the corresponding stdlib abstract
// component with a GTK4-native implementation. The widget types those bodies
// are written against — `gtk.GtkButton`, `gtk.GtkLabel`, one per GTK class —
// are the `gir:Gtk-4.0` package, which the library's gir: scheme generates
// from the introspection data gtk4's `gir` option selects: the widget set is a
// property of the host and not of this repository. A GIR property becomes a
// typed prop, a GLib signal an event, an action a method, and
// `#[intrinsic("gtk4:<CType>")]` names the C type the emitter reads the
// class's C API back out of the same GIR under. A `gir` naming no file it can
// read makes the platform unavailable, and it then contributes nothing.
//
// The view renderer walks each component body, finds the root VisualNode,
// reads its widget type and prop/event bindings, and emits the corresponding
// GTK4 Go code.
